# No read by name has the proxy for its receiver. The body of the trap counts in the handler and reads the slot of the target.
# CHECK-LABEL: function f0
# CHECK: [[target]]: L1 = NewObject
# CHECK: [[proxy]]: Proxy = CallBuiltin -, {{*}} overload=Proxy/1
# CHECK-NOT: = PropGet [[proxy]]
# CHECK: PutSlot {{*}} key="reads"
# CHECK-NOT: = PropGet [[proxy]]
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}} key="alpha"
# What the trap answers is held against the target only where the target may bind it.
# CHECK: [[binds]]: boolean = MayBindAnswersOfGetAndSetTraps
# CHECK-NEXT: TestAndBranch [[binds]] -> taken [[validates]](), notTaken
# CHECK: [[validates]]() frequency=Rare:
# CHECK-NEXT: ValidateAnswerOfGetTrap
# A handler that has lost the trap: the slot of the target where it is filled, else the target is asked for the proxy.
# CHECK: = SuperGet {{*}}, [[proxy]] key="alpha"
# CHECK-NOT: = PropGet [[proxy]]
# CHECK-LABEL: function f1
